# Correct pattern: STATE, ACTION, PROCESS nodes; transitions on edges only
# The prepare scroll runs in both journeys below, so it lives in one reusable block.

block prepare_scroll | Prepare scroll to play | Pull display back to prepare time, reset surviving tiles, then unwind the delta
node pull | Pull phase tick | - | AppContext.State.cs | verified | process
step pull | 1. Advance pull elapsed and interpolate display toward the anchor.
node pull_done | Complete pull phase | Sole reset point of the scroll. | AppContext.State.cs | verified | checkpoint
step pull_done | 1. Apply deferred long-hold resets and reset surviving tiles for prepare scroll.
node unwind | Delta unwind tick | - | AppContext.State.cs | verified | process
step unwind | 1. Decrease prepare delta at audio speed until zero.
verify unwind | Display offset should track prepare delta during unwind.
verify unwind | Confirm audio seeks to display time each unwind tick.
node unwind_done | Complete delta unwind | - | AppContext.State.cs | verified | checkpoint
step unwind_done | 1. Clear prepare delta and restore playback from the rewind exit state.
edge pull -> pull | each frame while pull active
edge pull -> pull_done | pull duration complete
edge pull_done -> unwind | prepare delta still positive
edge unwind -> unwind | each frame while delta positive
edge unwind -> unwind_done | prepare delta reaches zero
endblock

flow demo | 00 · States and edges | Minimal pause slice showing node kinds
node playing | APP_PLAY | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
node pause_btn | PauseGame entry | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
node pause_cut | Apply pause note cut | Resolves the pause keep line and purges tiles below it. | AppContext.State.cs | verified | checkpoint
step pause_cut | 1. Resolve the keep line from live tiles.
step pause_cut | 2. Purge every attached tile below the keep line.
step pause_cut | 3. Save the resume anchor for the prepare scroll.
node paused | APP_PAUSE | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
node resume_btn | ResumeGame entry | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
verify pause_btn | Context not initialized: return without state or tile writes.
node resume_mode | Resume mode dispatch | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
verify resume_btn | Resume rejected: return without state writes.
node rewind | APP_REWIND | - | AppContext.State.cs | verified | checkpoint
useblock scroll | prepare_scroll | Resume scroll runs with cause ResumeAfterPause and exit state APP_PLAY.
edge playing -> pause_btn | player pauses
edge pause_btn -> pause_cut | pause accepted
edge pause_cut -> paused | note cut and anchor saved
edge paused -> resume_btn | player resumes
edge resume_btn -> resume_mode | resume accepted
edge resume_mode -> rewind | prepare scroll opens the rewind window
edge rewind -> scroll | pull duration and prepare time both positive
edge rewind -> scroll.unwind | frozen delta already at target
edge scroll -> playing | enter APP_PLAY
end

flow revive | 01 · Revive to playing | Revive tap reuses the same prepare scroll as resume
node dead | APP_REVIVE | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
node revive_tap | ReviveGame entry | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
node rewind2 | APP_REWIND | - | AppContext.State.cs | verified | checkpoint
node playing2 | APP_PLAY | - | AppContext.Api.cs | verified | checkpoint
useblock scroll | prepare_scroll | Revive scroll reopens the window from the preserved death anchor.
edge dead -> revive_tap | valid revive tap
edge revive_tap -> rewind2 | revive window opened
edge rewind2 -> scroll | prepared revive timing
edge scroll -> playing2 | enter APP_PLAY
end
